<tr><td>Drip edge</td><td>Full eave and rake length</td><td>Photos of edges, code reference</td></tr>
<tr><td>Underlayment</td><td>Full area, correct type</td><td>Manufacturer instructions, code reference</td></tr>
<tr><td>Flashing</td><td>Step, counter, chimney, valley, headwall</td><td>Close-up photos of each location</td></tr>
