<tr><td>Code items</td><td>Items the adopted code requires</td><td>Code section, building official guidance, permit if any</td></tr>
<tr><td>Matching</td><td>Replacement shingles reasonably match</td><td>Shingle brand and line, discontinuation evidence, photos</td></tr>
